        <item>
            <title>0.15.6</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:50:51 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1506</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.15.6</h2>
<p><b>Gmail links from a task now open the email.</b> Every Gmail citation Jarvis
wrote pointed at an address Gmail refuses, so clicking one landed on
"Temporary Error (404)" instead of the message. This update fixes the links it
writes from now on and repairs the ones already on your Mac, the first time you
open the app.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Gmail citations in a task's "Where this came from" open the right mailbox
      and the right thread.</li>
  <li>Links stored from earlier syncs are repaired automatically — nothing to
      re-sync, and no email is re-read or re-indexed.</li>
  <li>No changes to your data, your connections, or what leaves your Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
